1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,568
Writing, task two. E-mail number 9: A lost bag.

2
00:00:06,267 --> 00:00:16,124
You lost your bag on a train. Write an e-mail to Czech Railways. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

3
00:00:24,833 --> 00:00:25,900
Good afternoon,

4
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:28,229
yesterday I lost my bag on the train.

5
00:00:28,533 --> 00:00:30,408
I was travelling by train from Kralupy to Prague.

6
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:32,892
It was on Monday morning at seven o'clock.

7
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,625
The bag is black, leather and small.

8
00:00:35,933 --> 00:00:39,054
In the bag there are documents, a wallet and keys.

9
00:00:39,367 --> 00:00:46,117
Please, if you find it, call me on 604 321 987. Thank you.

10
00:00:46,433 --> 00:00:53,874
This e-mail has 52 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

11
00:00:54,567 --> 00:01:03,577
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
